  "body": "Looking for top-tier school zones without the extreme price tag?\r\nWelcome to 38C Glennandrew Drive, Half Moon Bay-a beautifully presented, executive family home that truly stands out from the rest. This property represents the perfect entry point into Auckland’s most prestigious neighbourhood, combining elite education with luxury, low-maintenance living.\r\nWhy This Property Stands Out:\r\n* No Expense Spared: Unlike standard builds, the vendor has invested heavily in premium upgrades. Experience the natural warmth of real solid timber flooring underfoot and precision-crafted, German-made water tapware.\r\n*  Ultimate Comfort & Security: Enjoy complete peace of mind with a fully electronic-gated entry and plenty of secure off-street parking. The entire home is fully insulated to the highest standards, ensuring a warm, dry, and energy-efficient environment for your family all year round.\r\n* Sensational Indoor-Outdoor Flow: The light-filled, open-plan dining and living areas seamlessly float out to a sun-soaked Kwila timber deck. It’s the ultimate setup for weekend BBQs, family gatherings, and entertaining guests in style.\r\n* Gourmet Designer Kitchen: A true masterpiece for the home chef, featuring sleek modern cabinetry, premium appliances, and ample bench space.\r\n* Space for Growing Families: Offers 4 generously sized double bedrooms with built-in storage, providing everyone in the family their own private sanctuary.\r\nAn Unbeatable Lifestyle & Location:\r\n* The Ultimate School Trifecta: Secure your children’s academic future with unmatched zoning for the area's top-rated schools: Pigeon Mountain School, Bucklands Beach Intermediate (BBI), and the world-class Macleans College.\r\n* Community at Your Doorstep: Located in a quiet, highly desirable pocket of Half Moon Bay. Enjoy peaceful evening strolls with your loved ones to Glennandrew Park just down the road or take a short drive to the vibrant Half Moon Bay Marina for commuter ferries, waterfront dining, and shopping.\r\nThis is a rare combination of quality, location, and affordability that is incredibly hard to find in this market. The vendor is highly motivated and ready to meet the market.\r\nDon't let this slip away-call us today to arrange a private viewing or join us at our next open home!",
